{"unit_id":"chuxumilk__dsh-404-panic-lock#card-zh","repo":"chuxumilk/dsh-404-panic-lock","commit":"a760badc4eb4f4b9f2f45b509aa55b967147425a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"404 Panic Lock 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的临时防打扰插件。它通过浏览器客户端注册快捷键，在按下 Ctrl+Shift+L 时把当前页面覆盖为一张静态的 404 错误页图片，并将标题改为 404 Not Found；再次按下快捷键即可移除遮罩并恢复原标题。锁定时会尝试进入浏览器全屏、让当前输入框失焦，并拦截键盘输入和右键菜单。插件停止时会移除事件监听并清理锁定状态。适合需要暂时遮住 DSH 页面、减少旁人看到屏幕内容的 Web 用户；无需 API Key、账号或外部服务，使用 web profile 安装即可。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:129-187","client.js:193-204","package.json:31-40"]}
{"unit_id":"chuxumilk__dsh-404-panic-lock#card-en","repo":"chuxumilk/dsh-404-panic-lock","commit":"a760badc4eb4f4b9f2f45b509aa55b967147425a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"404 Panic Lock covers DSH web with a static 404 image. Press Ctrl+Shift+L to lock and again to restore the title and remove the overlay. It intercepts keyboard input and context menus, blurs the active field, and requests fullscreen. Stopping the plugin unlocks the page. No key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:129-187","client.js:193-204","package.json:31-40"]}
