{"unit_id":"chuxumilk__dsh-404-panic-lock#feature-1","repo":"chuxumilk/dsh-404-panic-lock","commit":"a760badc4eb4f4b9f2f45b509aa55b967147425a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"404 Panic Lock 的功能「快捷键切换遮罩」：在 DSH Web 页面按 Ctrl+Shift+L 可显示静态 404 图片，再按一次移除遮罩并恢复原标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:129-163","client.js:165-186"]}
