{"unit_id":"chuxumilk__dsh-404-panic-lock#feature-3","repo":"chuxumilk/dsh-404-panic-lock","commit":"a760badc4eb4f4b9f2f45b509aa55b967147425a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"404 Panic Lock 的功能「锁定输入」：锁定期间拦截键盘事件和右键菜单，并让当前焦点元素失焦，减少页面交互。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:129-136","client.js:174-191"]}
{"unit_id":"chuxumilk__dsh-404-panic-lock#feature-4","repo":"chuxumilk/dsh-404-panic-lock","commit":"a760badc4eb4f4b9f2f45b509aa55b967147425a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"404 Panic Lock 的功能「全屏遮罩」：启用锁定时请求浏览器全屏；全屏状态改变后重新绘制图片以适配新视口，解锁时请求退出全屏。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:99-127","client.js:165-172"]}
